{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrency-parallelism-implementation","title":"并发与并行的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/concurrency-and-parallelism/concurrency-parallelism-implementation","wordCount":1965,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"并发与并行的实现机制\">并发与并行的实现机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实现并发与并行的机制横跨四个层次：<strong>操作系统级</strong>（进程、线程）、<strong>用户级</strong>（协程、事件驱动）、<strong>硬件级</strong>（多核 CPU、GPU）与<strong>系统级</strong>（分布式系统）。选择哪一种，取决于隔离性、开销与扩展性三者的权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>隔离性</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>进程</strong></td>\n<td>操作系统级</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要强隔离（浏览器多标签、微服务）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>线程</strong></td>\n<td>操作系统级</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>共享数据的多核并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>协程</strong></td>\n<td>用户级</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高并发 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>事件驱动</strong></td>\n<td>用户级</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>单线程高并发 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>GPU</strong></td>\n<td>硬件级</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>大规模数据并行计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;并发与并行的实现机制&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;并发机制&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;并行机制&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[&quot;进程:强隔离,开销大&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[&quot;线程:共享数据,可利用多核&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[&quot;协程 / 事件驱动:用户级,开销极低&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[&quot;多核 CPU:真正同时执行&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[&quot;分布式系统:横向扩展&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[&quot;GPU:大规模数据并行&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"并发与并行的实现机制\"] --&gt; B[\"并发机制\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"并行机制\"]\n  B --&gt; B1[\"进程:强隔离,开销大\"]\n  B --&gt; B2[\"线程:共享数据,可利用多核\"]\n  B --&gt; B3[\"协程 / 事件驱动:用户级,开销极低\"]\n  C --&gt; C1[\"多核 CPU:真正同时执行\"]\n  C --&gt; C2[\"分布式系统:横向扩展\"]\n  C --&gt; C3[\"GPU:大规模数据并行\"]</pre><p>一条实用的选择原则：<strong>先看瓶颈，再看隔离需求</strong>——I/O 瓶颈优先协程或事件驱动，CPU 瓶颈优先线程或多核并行；需要强隔离或独立部署时，才付出进程或分布式的开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>实现并发和并行有多种机制，从操作系统级的进程和线程，到用户级的协程和事件驱动模型，再到硬件级的多核 CPU、分布式系统和 GPU 并行计算。不同机制适用于不同场景，理解它们的特点和适用范围是做出正确技术选型的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;Implementation Mechanisms of Concurrency and Parallelism&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Concurrency Mechanisms&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Parallelism Mechanisms&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Process&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;Thread&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;Coroutine&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[&quot;Event-driven&lt;br/&gt;(epoll / select)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Multi-core CPU&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Distributed System&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;GPU Parallel Computing&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"Implementation Mechanisms of Concurrency and Parallelism\"] --&gt; B[\"Concurrency Mechanisms\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Parallelism Mechanisms\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Process\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"Thread\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"Coroutine\"]\n    B --&gt; B4[\"Event-driven&lt;br/&gt;(epoll / select)\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Multi-core CPU\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Distributed System\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"GPU Parallel Computing\"]</pre><h2 id=\"并发机制一-进程\">并发机制一：进程</h2><p>进程（Process）是操作系统中资源分配的基本单位。每个进程拥有独立的<strong>地址空间、文件描述符、堆和栈</strong>，进程之间完全隔离。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Process A&#10;        direction TB&#10;        PA1[&quot;Code Segment&quot;]&#10;        PA2[&quot;Data Segment + Heap&quot;]&#10;        PA3[&quot;Stack&quot;]&#10;        PA4[&quot;File Descriptor Table&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Process B&#10;        direction TB&#10;        PB1[&quot;Code Segment&quot;]&#10;        PB2[&quot;Data Segment + Heap&quot;]&#10;        PB3[&quot;Stack&quot;]&#10;        PB4[&quot;File Descriptor Table&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    PA1 -.-&gt;|&quot;Completely isolated&lt;br/&gt;no shared memory&quot;| PB1\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Process A\n        direction TB\n        PA1[\"Code Segment\"]\n        PA2[\"Data Segment + Heap\"]\n        PA3[\"Stack\"]\n        PA4[\"File Descriptor Table\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Process B\n        direction TB\n        PB1[\"Code Segment\"]\n        PB2[\"Data Segment + Heap\"]\n        PB3[\"Stack\"]\n        PB4[\"File Descriptor Table\"]\n    end\n    PA1 -.-&gt;|\"Completely isolated&lt;br/&gt;no shared memory\"| PB1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隔离性</td>\n<td>进程间内存完全隔离，一个进程崩溃不影响其他进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信方式</td>\n<td>管道、消息队列、共享内存、Socket 等 IPC 机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建开销</td>\n<td>高（需要复制地址空间，即使使用 COW）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换开销</td>\n<td>高（需要切换页表、刷新 TLB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>需要强隔离的场景（如浏览器多标签页、微服务）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 多进程并发模型&#10;主进程:&#10;    for i = 1 to N:&#10;        子进程 = fork()&#10;        if 子进程:&#10;            处理任务(i)&#10;            exit()&#10;    等待所有子进程完成()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 多进程并发模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>主进程:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i = 1 to N:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        子进程 = fork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if 子进程:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            处理任务(i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            exit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    等待所有子进程完成()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发机制二-线程\">并发机制二：线程</h2><p>线程（Thread）是 CPU 调度的基本单位。同一进程内的多个线程<strong>共享地址空间和文件描述符</strong>，但各自拥有独立的栈和寄存器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Process&#10;        direction TB&#10;        SHARED[&quot;Shared Region&lt;br/&gt;Code Segment | Data Segment | Heap | File Descriptors&quot;]&#10;        subgraph Thread Level&#10;            T1[&quot;Thread 1&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack + Registers&quot;]&#10;            T2[&quot;Thread 2&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack + Registers&quot;]&#10;            T3[&quot;Thread 3&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack + Registers&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;        SHARED --&gt; T1&#10;        SHARED --&gt; T2&#10;        SHARED --&gt; T3&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Process\n        direction TB\n        SHARED[\"Shared Region&lt;br/&gt;Code Segment | Data Segment | Heap | File Descriptors\"]\n        subgraph Thread Level\n            T1[\"Thread 1&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack + Registers\"]\n            T2[\"Thread 2&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack + Registers\"]\n            T3[\"Thread 3&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack + Registers\"]\n        end\n        SHARED --&gt; T1\n        SHARED --&gt; T2\n        SHARED --&gt; T3\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享内存</td>\n<td>同一进程内的线程共享堆内存，通信高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步需求</td>\n<td>共享数据需要锁、信号量等同步机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建开销</td>\n<td>中等（约 1MB 栈空间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换开销</td>\n<td>中等（内核态上下文切换）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>CPU 密集型任务的并行化、需要共享数据的并发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function workerTask(id: number, data: number[]): number {&#10;  let sum = 0;&#10;  for (const val of data) {&#10;    sum += val;&#10;  }&#10;  return sum;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function parallelSum(arr: number[], numThreads: number): Promise&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  const chunkSize = Math.ceil(arr.length / numThreads);&#10;  const promises: Promise&lt;number&gt;[] = [];&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; numThreads; i++) {&#10;    const chunk = arr.slice(i * chunkSize, (i + 1) * chunkSize);&#10;    promises.push(runInWorker(workerTask, i, chunk));&#10;  }&#10;  const results = await Promise.all(promises);&#10;  return results.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> workerTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parallelSum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">numThreads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunkSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arr.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numThreads);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> promises</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numThreads; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkSize, (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    promises.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runInWorker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(workerTask, i, chunk));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(promises);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发机制三-协程\">并发机制三：协程</h2><p>协程（Coroutine）是用户级的轻量执行单元，由用户程序调度而非内核调度。协程的创建和切换开销极低，适合管理大量并发 I/O 任务。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调度方式</td>\n<td>用户态协作式调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建开销</td>\n<td>极低（约 2~8 KB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换开销</td>\n<td>极低（纳秒级，用户态完成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发规模</td>\n<td>可达百万级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>I/O 密集型高并发（Web 服务器、网络编程）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function handleConnection(conn: Connection): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const request = await conn.readRequest();&#10;  const data = await queryDatabase(request.query);&#10;  const response = buildResponse(data);&#10;  await conn.writeResponse(response);&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function server(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const listener = createListener(8080);&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    const conn = await listener.accept();&#10;    handleConnection(conn);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">conn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> queryDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request.query);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> listener</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> conn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listener.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">accept</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    handleConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发机制四-事件驱动\">并发机制四：事件驱动</h2><p>事件驱动（Event-Driven）模型使用<strong>单线程 + I/O 多路复用</strong>来管理大量并发连接。核心是操作系统提供的 I/O 多路复用接口（如 <code>epoll</code>、<code>kqueue</code>、<code>select</code>），它们可以在单个线程中同时监听数千个文件描述符的 I/O 事件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Event-Driven Model&#10;        direction TB&#10;        EL[&quot;Event Loop&lt;br/&gt;(single thread)&quot;] --&gt; MUX[&quot;I/O Multiplexing&lt;br/&gt;(epoll / kqueue)&quot;]&#10;        MUX --&gt;|&quot;Connection 1 readable&quot;| H1[&quot;Handle Connection 1&quot;]&#10;        MUX --&gt;|&quot;Connection 2 writable&quot;| H2[&quot;Handle Connection 2&quot;]&#10;        MUX --&gt;|&quot;Connection 3 readable&quot;| H3[&quot;Handle Connection 3&quot;]&#10;        MUX --&gt;|&quot;Timer triggered&quot;| H4[&quot;Handle Timer&quot;]&#10;        H1 --&gt; EL&#10;        H2 --&gt; EL&#10;        H3 --&gt; EL&#10;        H4 --&gt; EL&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Event-Driven Model\n        direction TB\n        EL[\"Event Loop&lt;br/&gt;(single thread)\"] --&gt; MUX[\"I/O Multiplexing&lt;br/&gt;(epoll / kqueue)\"]\n        MUX --&gt;|\"Connection 1 readable\"| H1[\"Handle Connection 1\"]\n        MUX --&gt;|\"Connection 2 writable\"| H2[\"Handle Connection 2\"]\n        MUX --&gt;|\"Connection 3 readable\"| H3[\"Handle Connection 3\"]\n        MUX --&gt;|\"Timer triggered\"| H4[\"Handle Timer\"]\n        H1 --&gt; EL\n        H2 --&gt; EL\n        H3 --&gt; EL\n        H4 --&gt; EL\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"i-o-多路复用对比\">I/O 多路复用对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>最大连接数</th>\n<th>效率</th>\n<th>工作方式</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>select</code></td>\n<td>1024（默认）</td>\n<td>低（每次扫描所有 fd）</td>\n<td>轮询</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>poll</code></td>\n<td>无硬限制</td>\n<td>低（每次扫描所有 fd）</td>\n<td>轮询</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>epoll</code></td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n<td>高（只返回就绪的 fd）</td>\n<td>事件通知</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kqueue</code></td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n<td>高（只返回就绪的 fd）</td>\n<td>事件通知</td>\n<td>macOS / BSD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 事件驱动模型伪代码&#10;函数 eventDrivenServer():&#10;    epoll = 创建epoll实例()&#10;    server_fd = 创建监听socket(8080)&#10;    epoll.注册(server_fd, 可读事件)&#10;&#10;    while true:&#10;        events = epoll.等待事件()&#10;        for event in events:&#10;            if event.fd == server_fd:&#10;                new_conn = accept(server_fd)&#10;                epoll.注册(new_conn, 可读事件)&#10;            else if event.type == 可读:&#10;                data = 非阻塞读取(event.fd)&#10;                处理数据(data)&#10;                epoll.修改(event.fd, 可写事件)&#10;            else if event.type == 可写:&#10;                非阻塞写入(event.fd, response)&#10;                epoll.修改(event.fd, 可读事件)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 事件驱动模型伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>函数 eventDrivenServer():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    epoll = 创建epoll实例()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server_fd = 创建监听socket(8080)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    epoll.注册(server_fd, 可读事件)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        events = epoll.等待事件()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for event in events:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if event.fd == server_fd:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                new_conn = accept(server_fd)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                epoll.注册(new_conn, 可读事件)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else if event.type == 可读:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                data = 非阻塞读取(event.fd)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                处理数据(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                epoll.修改(event.fd, 可写事件)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else if event.type == 可写:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                非阻塞写入(event.fd, response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                epoll.修改(event.fd, 可读事件)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并行机制一-多核-cpu\">并行机制一：多核 CPU</h2><p>多核 CPU 是实现并行最直接的硬件基础。操作系统可以将不同的线程/进程调度到不同核心上，实现真正的同时执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph CPU Chip&#10;        direction LR&#10;        subgraph Core1&#10;            C1[&quot;ALU + Registers&quot;]&#10;            L1_1[&quot;L1 Cache&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph Core2&#10;            C2[&quot;ALU + Registers&quot;]&#10;            L1_2[&quot;L1 Cache&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph Core3&#10;            C3[&quot;ALU + Registers&quot;]&#10;            L1_3[&quot;L1 Cache&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph Core4&#10;            C4[&quot;ALU + Registers&quot;]&#10;            L1_4[&quot;L1 Cache&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;    Core1 --&gt; L2[&quot;Shared L2/L3 Cache&quot;]&#10;    Core2 --&gt; L2&#10;    Core3 --&gt; L2&#10;    Core4 --&gt; L2&#10;    L2 --&gt; MEM[&quot;Main Memory&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph CPU Chip\n        direction LR\n        subgraph Core1\n            C1[\"ALU + Registers\"]\n            L1_1[\"L1 Cache\"]\n        end\n        subgraph Core2\n            C2[\"ALU + Registers\"]\n            L1_2[\"L1 Cache\"]\n        end\n        subgraph Core3\n            C3[\"ALU + Registers\"]\n            L1_3[\"L1 Cache\"]\n        end\n        subgraph Core4\n            C4[\"ALU + Registers\"]\n            L1_4[\"L1 Cache\"]\n        end\n    end\n    Core1 --&gt; L2[\"Shared L2/L3 Cache\"]\n    Core2 --&gt; L2\n    Core3 --&gt; L2\n    Core4 --&gt; L2\n    L2 --&gt; MEM[\"Main Memory\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享内存</td>\n<td>多核共享主内存，通过缓存一致性协议保持数据同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>受限于核心数和总线带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>通用并行计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并行机制二-分布式系统\">并行机制二：分布式系统</h2><p>当单机的多核 CPU 无法满足计算需求时，可以将任务分配到<strong>多台机器</strong>上并行执行。分布式系统通过网络将多台计算机连接起来，协同完成大规模任务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;Large-Scale Task&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Task Splitter&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; N1[&quot;Node 1&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard A&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; N2[&quot;Node 2&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard B&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; N3[&quot;Node 3&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard C&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; N4[&quot;Node N&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard ...&quot;]&#10;    N1 --&gt; C[&quot;Result Aggregator&quot;]&#10;    N2 --&gt; C&#10;    N3 --&gt; C&#10;    N4 --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Final Result&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"Large-Scale Task\"] --&gt; B[\"Task Splitter\"]\n    B --&gt; N1[\"Node 1&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard A\"]\n    B --&gt; N2[\"Node 2&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard B\"]\n    B --&gt; N3[\"Node 3&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard C\"]\n    B --&gt; N4[\"Node N&lt;br/&gt;Process Shard ...\"]\n    N1 --&gt; C[\"Result Aggregator\"]\n    N2 --&gt; C\n    N3 --&gt; C\n    N4 --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[\"Final Result\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通信方式</td>\n<td>通过网络（RPC、消息队列等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>理论上无限（水平扩展）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂性</td>\n<td>高（网络延迟、故障容错、数据一致性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型框架</td>\n<td>MapReduce、Spark、Flink</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>超大规模数据处理、高可用系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并行机制三-gpu-并行计算\">并行机制三：GPU 并行计算</h2><p>GPU（图形处理器）拥有<strong>数千个小型计算核心</strong>，擅长执行大量相同操作的并行任务（SIMT 模型）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph CPU&#10;        direction TB&#10;        CC1[&quot;Core 1&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)&quot;]&#10;        CC2[&quot;Core 2&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)&quot;]&#10;        CC3[&quot;Core 3&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)&quot;]&#10;        CC4[&quot;Core 4&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GPU&#10;        direction TB&#10;        GC[&quot;Thousands of small cores&lt;br/&gt;each core is weaker&lt;br/&gt;but extremely numerous&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    CPU --&gt;|&quot;Suited for: complex logic&lt;br/&gt;few threads&quot;| T1[&quot;Serial / low-parallelism tasks&quot;]&#10;    GPU --&gt;|&quot;Suited for: simple repetitive&lt;br/&gt;massive parallelism&quot;| T2[&quot;Large-scale data parallelism&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph CPU\n        direction TB\n        CC1[\"Core 1&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)\"]\n        CC2[\"Core 2&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)\"]\n        CC3[\"Core 3&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)\"]\n        CC4[\"Core 4&lt;br/&gt;(powerful)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph GPU\n        direction TB\n        GC[\"Thousands of small cores&lt;br/&gt;each core is weaker&lt;br/&gt;but extremely numerous\"]\n    end\n    CPU --&gt;|\"Suited for: complex logic&lt;br/&gt;few threads\"| T1[\"Serial / low-parallelism tasks\"]\n    GPU --&gt;|\"Suited for: simple repetitive&lt;br/&gt;massive parallelism\"| T2[\"Large-scale data parallelism\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CPU</th>\n<th>GPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心数量</td>\n<td>4~64 个（强大核心）</td>\n<td>数千~上万个（简单核心）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单核能力</td>\n<td>强（复杂逻辑、分支预测）</td>\n<td>弱（简单算术运算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行模式</td>\n<td>任务并行（不同核心做不同事）</td>\n<td>数据并行（所有核心做同一操作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>通用计算、操作系统、应用程序</td>\n<td>图形渲染、深度学习、科学计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"全面对比-所有并发与并行机制\">全面对比：所有并发与并行机制</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>创建开销</th>\n<th>切换开销</th>\n<th>并发/并行规模</th>\n<th>通信方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>进程</strong></td>\n<td>并发+并行</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>数百~数千</td>\n<td>IPC（管道、Socket）</td>\n<td>强隔离、安全敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>线程</strong></td>\n<td>并发+并行</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>数千~数万</td>\n<td>共享内存 + 锁</td>\n<td>CPU 密集型并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>协程</strong></td>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n<td>Channel、await</td>\n<td>I/O 密集型高并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>事件驱动</strong></td>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>无（单线程）</td>\n<td>无（回调切换）</td>\n<td>十万级连接</td>\n<td>回调/事件</td>\n<td>高并发网络服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>多核 CPU</strong></td>\n<td>并行</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>核心数</td>\n<td>共享内存</td>\n<td>通用并行计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>分布式</strong></td>\n<td>并行</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>理论无限</td>\n<td>网络（RPC、MQ）</td>\n<td>超大规模任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>GPU</strong></td>\n<td>并行</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>数千~数万线程</td>\n<td>显存</td>\n<td>数据密集型并行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"如何选择正确的实现方式\">如何选择正确的实现方式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Choose Concurrency/Parallelism Strategy&quot;] --&gt; Q1{&quot;Main bottleneck?&quot;}&#10;&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;I/O intensive&quot;| Q2{&quot;Number of concurrent connections?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;CPU intensive&quot;| Q3{&quot;Can a single machine handle it?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Hybrid&quot;| MIX[&quot;Multi-thread + Coroutines&lt;br/&gt;(Thread pool + Event loop)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;&lt; 1000&quot;| A1[&quot;Multi-thread&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;1000 ~ 100K&quot;| A2[&quot;Event-driven&lt;br/&gt;(epoll + callbacks)&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;&gt; 100K&quot;| A3[&quot;Coroutines&lt;br/&gt;(async/await)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| Q4{&quot;Can the task be split?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| A4[&quot;Distributed System&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|&quot;Yes, data parallelism&quot;| Q5{&quot;Need massive parallelism?&quot;}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|&quot;Yes, task parallelism&quot;| A5[&quot;Multi-thread / Multi-process&quot;]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| A6[&quot;Optimize the algorithm&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Q5 --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| A7[&quot;GPU Parallelism&quot;]&#10;    Q5 --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| A5\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Choose Concurrency/Parallelism Strategy\"] --&gt; Q1{\"Main bottleneck?\"}\n\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"I/O intensive\"| Q2{\"Number of concurrent connections?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"CPU intensive\"| Q3{\"Can a single machine handle it?\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Hybrid\"| MIX[\"Multi-thread + Coroutines&lt;br/&gt;(Thread pool + Event loop)\"]\n\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"&lt; 1000\"| A1[\"Multi-thread\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"1000 ~ 100K\"| A2[\"Event-driven&lt;br/&gt;(epoll + callbacks)\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"&gt; 100K\"| A3[\"Coroutines&lt;br/&gt;(async/await)\"]\n\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"Yes\"| Q4{\"Can the task be split?\"}\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"No\"| A4[\"Distributed System\"]\n\n    Q4 --&gt;|\"Yes, data parallelism\"| Q5{\"Need massive parallelism?\"}\n    Q4 --&gt;|\"Yes, task parallelism\"| A5[\"Multi-thread / Multi-process\"]\n    Q4 --&gt;|\"No\"| A6[\"Optimize the algorithm\"]\n\n    Q5 --&gt;|\"Yes\"| A7[\"GPU Parallelism\"]\n    Q5 --&gt;|\"No\"| A5</pre><h3 id=\"决策要点\">决策要点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策因素</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需要强隔离</td>\n<td>多进程</td>\n<td>进程间内存隔离，一个崩溃不影响其他</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要共享数据</td>\n<td>多线程</td>\n<td>线程共享地址空间，通信高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海量 I/O 连接</td>\n<td>协程或事件驱动</td>\n<td>极低的资源开销，可处理百万连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 密集 + 可拆分</td>\n<td>多线程或多进程</td>\n<td>利用多核真正并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超大规模数据</td>\n<td>分布式系统</td>\n<td>水平扩展突破单机瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模数据并行</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>数千核心同时处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>进程</strong>提供最强的隔离性，适合安全敏感和需要独立故障域的场景，但创建和切换开销最高。</li>\n<li><strong>线程</strong>在同一进程内共享内存，通信高效但需要同步机制，适合 CPU 密集型并行任务。</li>\n<li><strong>协程</strong>是用户级轻量执行单元，创建和切换开销极低，适合管理百万级 I/O 密集型并发连接。</li>\n<li><strong>事件驱动</strong>通过 I/O 多路复用（epoll/kqueue）在单线程中管理大量连接，是高性能网络服务器的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>多核 CPU</strong> 是并行的硬件基础，通过将线程/进程调度到不同核心实现真正的同时执行。</li>\n<li><strong>分布式系统</strong>通过多台机器协同工作，实现理论上无限的水平扩展能力。</li>\n<li><strong>GPU</strong> 拥有数千个小核心，擅长大规模数据并行任务（图形渲染、深度学习等）。</li>\n<li>实际系统中，应根据瓶颈类型（I/O vs CPU）、并发规模、隔离需求等因素，选择合适的机制或组合使用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并发与并行的实现机制","id":"并发与并行的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"并发机制一：进程","id":"并发机制一-进程"},{"level":2,"text":"并发机制二：线程","id":"并发机制二-线程"},{"level":2,"text":"并发机制三：协程","id":"并发机制三-协程"},{"level":2,"text":"并发机制四：事件驱动","id":"并发机制四-事件驱动"},{"level":3,"text":"I/O 多路复用对比","id":"i-o-多路复用对比"},{"level":2,"text":"并行机制一：多核 CPU","id":"并行机制一-多核-cpu"},{"level":2,"text":"并行机制二：分布式系统","id":"并行机制二-分布式系统"},{"level":2,"text":"并行机制三：GPU 并行计算","id":"并行机制三-gpu-并行计算"},{"level":2,"text":"全面对比：所有并发与并行机制","id":"全面对比-所有并发与并行机制"},{"level":2,"text":"如何选择正确的实现方式","id":"如何选择正确的实现方式"},{"level":3,"text":"决策要点","id":"决策要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并发与并行的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/concurrency-and-parallelism/concurrency-parallelism-ideas"},"next":{"title":"原子操作的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-definition-and-concepts"}}